      "created_at": "2015-01-12T00:04:13.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>With Korruption, the card reads:</p><blockquote><p>At the end of the environment turn, this card deals each non-environment target 1 melee damage.&nbsp; Then, this card deals any target damaged this way 1 toxic damage.</p></blockquote><p>Is the toxic damage dealt immediately if the melee is successful or does each target get the melee damage first, then each successfully hit target get hit for one toxic?</p><p>Thanks,<br>Ben</p>",
