      "created_at": "2015-01-12T01:26:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Really Ronway?&nbsp; I would certainly usually play that way in tabletop, just because it's easier, and wouldn't *usually* make a difference.&nbsp; But in terms of correctness, those are two completely separate sentences, and I would expect them to happen separately when evaluated by the App.&nbsp; It could easily make a difference when interacting with Bee Bot.</p>",
