    {
      "id": 126882,
      "name": "phantaskippy",
      "username": "phantaskippy",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-12T03:24:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What is nice is if Haka takes the damage for the entire party he only takes 1 from the second part. &nbsp;If it worked like Incidental Contact he would take 1 and 1 for each hero target.</p>",
